{"id":"b30d0f07110807814c0ff8ec5ec3b8027c3fcbaf801a0756b92abf30c020adf2","pubkey":"f776bcc12271be79fc71b655f3cbfeb3a8a169f33ee1335fcc0c22829901da4a","created_at":1782419109,"content":"https://npub17amtesfzwxl8nlr3ke2l8jl7kw52z60n8msnxh7vps3g9xgpmf9qx5nldk.blossom.band/e1f8dd9e47dba01404b9525c9d6f80e3a99381426f1fe812e1045cdbbb706b38.mp4\n\nToday I took water,  cans of tuna, clothes, and  blankets to one of the collection centers in my city.\n\n There were many people united, bringing supplies to be donated. \n\nEven so, my idea is to send donations directly to the affected city (Caracas) through an aunt who is there right now\n#venezuela","tags":[["alt","A short note: https://npub17amtesfzwxl8nlr3ke2l8jl7kw52z60n8msnx..."],["t","venezuela"],["r","https://npub17amtesfzwxl8nlr3ke2l8jl7kw52z60n8msnxh7vps3g9xgpmf9qx5nldk.blossom.band/e1f8dd9e47dba01404b9525c9d6f80e3a99381426f1fe812e1045cdbbb706b38.mp4"],["p","f776bcc12271be79fc71b655f3cbfeb3a8a169f33ee1335fcc0c22829901da4a"],["imeta","url https://npub17amtesfzwxl8nlr3ke2l8jl7kw52z60n8msnxh7vps3g9xgpmf9qx5nldk.blossom.band/e1f8dd9e47dba01404b9525c9d6f80e3a99381426f1fe812e1045cdbbb706b38.mp4","x e1f8dd9e47dba01404b9525c9d6f80e3a99381426f1fe812e1045cdbbb706b38","size 7479692","m video/mp4","dim 720x954","blurhash _FHKeL?aNFMxIoxaocl.xURPNGV[oys:0JMwtRt7t8ofaeiHROtRoLazafR*k;btxtRjWBV@s:pI%2VsM|aeWBoe-U%2M{V@t7oeay=tx]R%sAt7WBWXt3tRs:j]j]ofWV","ox e1f8dd9e47dba01404b9525c9d6f80e3a99381426f1fe812e1045cdbbb706b38"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
