{"id":"5198fa04baaa01d6d183cf1cd57219e9dc238437eade7a2d49a4e653b86e99b7","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1782355622,"content":"Anno Domini\nhttps://nostr.download/5cbc42684a57973968067923b6f7d2758d275c88ad8288948d7f6d73566839ea.jpg\nWe use the abbreviation casually — A.D. — without feeling the weight of what it means.\n\nNot merely a calendar notation.\nNot merely “old Christian language.”\nNot merely a historical convention.\n\nIt means: In the year of Our Lord.\n\nA civilization once had the audacity to number time itself from the arrival of Christ.\n\nBefore Him.\nAfter Him.\nHistory cut at the Cross.\n\nEvery contract, empire, court, school, archive, war, treaty, birth certificate, and death record inherited that fracture in time.\n\nModernity may rename it.\nAcademia may flatten it.\nBureaucracy may sanitize it.\n\nBut the witness remains.\n\nThe calendar still remembers what the culture pretends to forget:\n\nTime was not merely counted.\nTime was conquered.\n\nAnno Domini.\nThe year belongs to the Lord.\n\n#AnnoDomini #AD #InTheYearOfOurLord #ChristIsKing #HistoryCutAtTheCross #TimeWasConquered #CivilizationalMemory #ChristianCivilization #TheCalendarRemembers #TheCross #SacredTime #Christendom #TheWitnessRemains #FaithAndHistory #LordOfTime #Logos #EmpireAndTheCross #WesternCivilization #TheYearBelongsToTheLord #DeusVult\n","tags":[["alt","A short note: Anno Domini\nhttps://nostr.download/5cbc42684a57973..."],["t","AnnoDomini"],["t","annodomini"],["t","AD"],["t","ad"],["t","InTheYearOfOurLord"],["t","intheyearofourlord"],["t","ChristIsKing"],["t","christisking"],["t","HistoryCutAtTheCross"],["t","historycutatthecross"],["t","TimeWasConquered"],["t","timewasconquered"],["t","CivilizationalMemory"],["t","civilizationalmemory"],["t","ChristianCivilization"],["t","christiancivilization"],["t","TheCalendarRemembers"],["t","thecalendarremembers"],["t","TheCross"],["t","thecross"],["t","SacredTime"],["t","sacredtime"],["t","Christendom"],["t","christendom"],["t","TheWitnessRemains"],["t","thewitnessremains"],["t","FaithAndHistory"],["t","faithandhistory"],["t","LordOfTime"],["t","lordoftime"],["t","Logos"],["t","logos"],["t","EmpireAndTheCross"],["t","empireandthecross"],["t","WesternCivilization"],["t","westerncivilization"],["t","TheYearBelongsToTheLord"],["t","theyearbelongstothelord"],["t","DeusVult"],["t","deusvult"],["r","https://nostr.download/5cbc42684a57973968067923b6f7d2758d275c88ad8288948d7f6d73566839ea.jpg"],["imeta","url https://nostr.download/5cbc42684a57973968067923b6f7d2758d275c88ad8288948d7f6d73566839ea.jpg","x 5cbc42684a57973968067923b6f7d2758d275c88ad8288948d7f6d73566839ea","size 185095","m image/jpeg","dim 1024x1536","blurhash ^896{tNJ0g$%s,V[~AWCE3s.s:WCEOs,$zRlIqof59s+?ER,Ipt6skayfkoeR,WC~9Nd9wxZt6Rk^iR+Iqt6xsWCRkoJt5WDfRoe58s.-TR+Rkoe","ox 5cbc42684a57973968067923b6f7d2758d275c88ad8288948d7f6d73566839ea"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
