{"id":"4fb00fce1661473c942ccf089c61f3050e32a61a6f67ad47e820eadca1989a9f","pubkey":"811002f2348bdaa52d89b18b7e90bbc6aa5b948eff3e3689c041d2ac0ccba15a","created_at":1782354929,"content":"ツルムラサキ、どうしたらいいのかわからないくらい生えてるけど、どんどん間引いて食べたらいいんだなって気づいた。というわけで今日も、収穫。\n\nhttps://image.nostr.build/6e73d11d3f883ec021f66ece973f92f1c24429317676e965de4a00dea3a8b129.jpg","tags":[["imeta","url https://image.nostr.build/6e73d11d3f883ec021f66ece973f92f1c24429317676e965de4a00dea3a8b129.jpg","blurhash eGFZV|*]-:FVIVS@a5ICtQo@-;spR9IUs:b.aiWBtQM|%MNYf*V@%2","dim 4032x3024"],["r","https://image.nostr.build/6e73d11d3f883ec021f66ece973f92f1c24429317676e965de4a00dea3a8b129.jpg"],["client","Damus"]]}
