{"id":"76bee4a8e4a82d09acd6253999e43e256ebfae00d441dfc7e38f29e0306d919c","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1782354874,"content":"https://nostr.download/5311ebecccbdf3191bc170315eb83271474e495802f3e6b50f5fbda644b273d9.jpg\nThe Bible does not present resurrection as mere survival.\n\nIt reveals resurrection as a mystery of transformation.\n\n> “Behold, I shew you a mystery;\nWe shall not all sleep, but we shall all be changed.”\n— 1 Corinthians 15:51\n\n\n\nThe secret is not that death is avoided.\n\nThe secret is that corruption is overcome.\n\nThe mortal does not negotiate with decay.\n\nThe mortal puts on immortality.\n\nThat is resurrection: not repair, not escape, not illusion — but incorruption revealed through Christ.\n\n> “I am the resurrection, and the life.”\n— John 11:25\n\n\n\nMortality is overcome by incorruption.\n\n#Resurrection #Bible #Christ #Faith #Incorruption #EternalLife #Scripture #Christianity #MysteryRevealed #John1125 #1Corinthians15","tags":[["alt","A short note: https://nostr.download/5311ebecccbdf3191bc170315eb..."],["t","Resurrection"],["t","resurrection"],["t","Bible"],["t","bible"],["t","Christ"],["t","christ"],["t","Faith"],["t","faith"],["t","Incorruption"],["t","incorruption"],["t","EternalLife"],["t","eternallife"],["t","Scripture"],["t","scripture"],["t","Christianity"],["t","christianity"],["t","MysteryRevealed"],["t","mysteryrevealed"],["t","John1125"],["t","john1125"],["t","1Corinthians15"],["t","1corinthians15"],["r","https://nostr.download/5311ebecccbdf3191bc170315eb83271474e495802f3e6b50f5fbda644b273d9.jpg"],["imeta","url https://nostr.download/5311ebecccbdf3191bc170315eb83271474e495802f3e6b50f5fbda644b273d9.jpg","x 5311ebecccbdf3191bc170315eb83271474e495802f3e6b50f5fbda644b273d9","size 179528","m image/jpeg","dim 1055x1491","blurhash ^HNm~Ko~00xZ9ZWC%%s,o$R,xuog9cM{D+a~oJoL00bcIps+jrRjx_s,IVNGR-t7s,RjxZofM{RjWBX9WYjrs.j[tRj[D*Rjs:s.%LV@xuxtoIRj","ox 5311ebecccbdf3191bc170315eb83271474e495802f3e6b50f5fbda644b273d9"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
